# A [[jibe#Noun|jibe]], [[reproach#Noun|reproach]], or [[taunt#Noun|taunt]], especially one [[make#Verb|made]] in a [[good-natured]] or [[teasing#Adjective|teasing]] [[manner#Noun|manner]].
